20	Half Day City Tour	<p>Discover the vibrant heart of Qatar with our Doha City Tour, a perfect introduction to the country&rsquo;s capital. Explore the scenic Doha Corniche, admire traditional Dhow boats at the harbour, and visit the world-renowned Museum of Islamic Art. Wander through Souq Waqif, a bustling marketplace filled with spices, textiles, and handicrafts, before heading to Katara Cultural Village&mdash;a hub of art, culture, and cuisine. The tour ends at The Pearl-Qatar, a stunning man-made island showcasing luxury living and modern architecture. Ideal for first-time visitors, this guided tour blends Doha&rsquo;s rich heritage and modern charm, offering an unforgettable Qatar travel experience.</p>	Explore Doha’s Corniche, Dhow Harbour, Souq Waqif, Katara Cultural Village & The Pearl, blending heritage, culture, and modern charm.	half-day-city-tour	335	t	2025-11-09 21:35:22.994919+00	2025-11-09 21:51:02.229383+00	t
