4	The Green Planet Dubai	\N	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;">Step into a living rainforest at <strong><span style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">The Green Planet Dubai</span></strong>, an extraordinary indoor bio-dome that brings the wonders of a tropical ecosystem to the heart of the city. Home to over<strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"> </strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">3,000 plants and animals</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">, </strong>this immersive attraction allows visitors to explore multi-level walkways surrounded by exotic birds, colorful butterflies, reptiles, and towering green canopies. Designed for families, nature enthusiasts, and school groups, The Green Planet offers <strong><span style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">interactive educational programs, animal encounters, and conservation awareness activities</span></strong>, making learning about biodiversity both fun and engaging. Guests can marvel at the unique ecosystem, experience up-close interactions with fascinating creatures, and enjoy a serene escape from the city&rsquo;s hustle. Whether you&rsquo;re seeking a day of family adventure, a hands-on learning experience, or a peaceful retreat into nature, <strong><span style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">The Green Planet Dubai</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"> </strong>provides a captivating journey into the heart of the rainforest. It&rsquo;s a must-visit destination for anyone passionate about wildlife and nature conservation.</span></p>	3	Dubai, United Arab Emirates	Dubai	25.0742823	55.1885387	480	112	\N	c8ba39cd-7e3b-435e-6ea1-33c90e73ab00	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/c8ba39cd-7e3b-435e-6ea1-33c90e73ab00/medium	the-green-planet-dubai	t	2025-10-16 22:24:36.28436+00	2025-12-01 19:37:24.308566+00
18	Global Village	\N	<p>Step into a world of culture, cuisine, and entertainment at Global Village Dubai, a seasonal destination celebrating diversity and international experiences. Featuring pavilions from countries around the globe, the venue allows visitors to explore unique crafts, traditional products, and authentic cuisines from every continent. Families, friends, and travelers can enjoy a lively atmosphere filled with live cultural performances, music, dance shows, and thrilling carnival rides that create a festive and engaging experience for all ages. Beyond shopping and dining, Global Village promotes cultural exchange and immersive entertainment, making it a hub for learning and leisure. Visitors can stroll through beautifully themed zones, capture memorable photos, and savor global flavors in a vibrant, family-friendly environment. Perfect for evening visits, group outings, and festive celebrations, Global Village Dubai combines shopping, entertainment, and cultural discovery into an unforgettable seasonal experience that highlights Dubai&rsquo;s spirit of innovation, diversity, and fun.</p>	3	Global Village, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	Dubai	25.0687531	55.3068329	\N	\N	\N	f5dc22a1-4988-491a-7178-9ddb2efc1700	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/f5dc22a1-4988-491a-7178-9ddb2efc1700/medium	global-village	t	2025-11-05 21:52:55.470121+00	2025-12-01 20:11:45.257997+00
