32	 Dubai Parks and Resorts	\N	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Dubai Parks and Resorts is the ultimate family entertainment destination, offering world-class theme parks, thrilling attractions, and unforgettable experiences all in one spectacular location. As the largest integrated theme park destination in the Middle East, Dubai Parks and Resorts features Motiongate Dubai, Legoland Dubai, Real Madrid World, Legoland Water Park, and Neon Galaxy &ndash; each packed with exciting rides, immersive worlds, and attractions for every age. Visitors can explore over 100 indoor and outdoor rides, from Hollywood-inspired adventures at Motiongate to LEGO-themed fun at Legoland and high-energy football experiences at Real Madrid World. Little ones will love the space-themed play zones at Neon Galaxy, while Riverland Dubai offers dining, entertainment, and scenic walkways for the whole family. Whether you&rsquo;re seeking adrenaline-pumping roller coasters, creative family activities, or relaxing resort stays at Lapita Hotel, Dubai Parks and Resorts promises an extraordinary day filled with excitement, discovery, and non-stop fun.</span></p>	3	\N	Dubai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	fff94a20-b351-4938-bd35-d7d0aad82000	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/fff94a20-b351-4938-bd35-d7d0aad82000/medium	dubai-parks-and-resorts	t	2025-11-05 22:06:34.148423+00	2025-12-01 19:35:22.151235+00
42	Dinner At The Sky 	\N	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Elevate your dining experience to new heights with Dinner in the Sky Dubai, a truly unique culinary adventure that combines luxury, thrill, and breathtaking views. Suspended 50 meters above the ground, guests indulge in gourmet meals prepared by world-class chefs while enjoying panoramic vistas of iconic Dubai landmarks, including Dubai Marina, JBR, and the city skyline. Perfect for romantic dinners, special celebrations, corporate events, or group outings, Dinner in the Sky offers an unforgettable blend of excitement and elegance. Every detail, from safety harnesses to personalized service, ensures a seamless and secure experience while you savor exquisite cuisine high above the city. Whether you are a foodie seeking a unique experience or a traveler looking to make memories in Dubai, this sky-high dining adventure promises thrills, luxury, and Instagram-worthy moments. Dinner in the Sky Dubai is more than a meal, it&rsquo;s an extraordinary journey suspended above the heart of the city.</span></p>	3	\N	Dubai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	67dc93b3-e1d8-460e-dbe4-5626ffa8cc00	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/67dc93b3-e1d8-460e-dbe4-5626ffa8cc00/medium	dinner-at-the-sky	t	2025-11-05 22:19:48.502549+00	2025-12-01 19:23:07.261024+00
41	La Perle By Dragone	\N	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Discover the magic of La Perle by Dragone Dubai, a world-class live show that redefines entertainment in the heart of Dubai. Set in a custom-built aqua theatre, this mesmerizing performance combines daring acrobatics, aerial stunts, and breathtaking special effects to create an unforgettable sensory experience. Created by the legendary Franco Dragone, La Perle features world-class artists performing gravity-defying feats over water and air, captivating audiences with every movement. With its seamless fusion of artistry, technology, and storytelling, the show immerses spectators in a vibrant world of wonder, elegance, and drama. Ideal for families, tourists, and culture enthusiasts, La Perle offers an extraordinary evening that goes beyond traditional theatre. From the moment the lights dim to the final spectacular act, audiences are transported into a stunning universe of adventure, beauty, and emotion. La Perle by Dragone Dubai is not just a show; it&rsquo;s a must-see spectacle that leaves lasting memories.&nbsp;</span></p>	3	\N	Dubai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	da5d7811-f76a-4b0a-3f87-348b5e13a400	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/da5d7811-f76a-4b0a-3f87-348b5e13a400/medium	la-perle-by-dragone	t	2025-11-05 22:18:51.266668+00	2025-12-01 19:23:49.973931+00
35	Sky Views Observatory	\N	<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Experience Dubai from breathtaking new heights at the Sky Views Observatory, one of the city&rsquo;s most thrilling and photogenic attractions. Located on the 52nd and 53rd floors of the iconic Address Sky View Hotel, this observatory offers panoramic views of Downtown Dubai, featuring unmatched sights of the Burj Khalifa, Sheikh Zayed Road, and the city&rsquo;s stunning skyline. Visitors can walk across the spectacular glass walkway, slide down the adrenaline-pumping outdoor glass slide, and capture incredible aerial photos from multiple viewing platforms. Combining adventure, architecture, and unforgettable scenery, Sky Views Observatory is perfect for thrill-seekers, photographers, couples, and travelers looking for a unique Dubai experience. Whether you&rsquo;re gliding through the sky on the transparent slide or taking in sweeping views of the city from above, Sky Views Dubai promises a memorable encounter with the city&rsquo;s extraordinary skyline. A must-visit attraction for anyone exploring Downtown Dubai.</span></p>	3	\N	Dubai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	e7ca7dea-e4df-4637-2abf-507a8a69dc00	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/e7ca7dea-e4df-4637-2abf-507a8a69dc00/medium	sky-views-observatory	t	2025-11-05 22:10:55.333099+00	2025-12-01 19:29:50.566734+00
