23	Dubai Creek	\N	<p>Discover the historic and cultural heart of Dubai at Dubai Creek, a scenic waterway that divides the vibrant districts of Deira and Bur Dubai. This iconic destination offers visitors a glimpse into the city&rsquo;s rich heritage, from traditional abra boat rides across the creek to exploring the bustling souks brimming with spices, textiles, and gold. Travelers can wander along the charming waterfront promenades, soaking in picturesque views, or immerse themselves in the lively markets where bargaining and local interactions bring the old city to life. Dubai Creek is a hub for cultural experiences, offering insights into traditional Emirati life, historic architecture, and the origins of Dubai as a trading port. Ideal for families, history enthusiasts, and curious explorers alike, a visit to Dubai Creek combines leisure, learning, and photography opportunities. Whether you&rsquo;re enjoying a sunset boat ride, shopping in vibrant markets, or strolling along the waterfront, this area promises a memorable journey into the heart of old Dubai.</p>	3	Dubai Creek, Deira, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	Deira	25.2514182	55.3215632	\N	\N	\N	35762fad-1196-4477-2475-6144ce5de200	https://imagedelivery.net/4J4CgzUI_LpQRpA_N1TErQ/35762fad-1196-4477-2475-6144ce5de200/medium	dubai-creek	t	2025-11-05 22:00:02.600741+00	2025-12-01 19:59:11.866759+00
