COPY public.group_trips (id, name, summary, description, country_id, duration_days, price, min_participants, max_participants, itinerary, inclusions, exclusions, slug, is_active, is_featured, image_id, created_at, updated_at, published_at, conversion_triggers) FROM stdin;
8	Cape Town & Garden Route Escape	Discover South Africa this February! Explore Cape Town, Table Mountain, Cape Point & the scenic Garden Route for the ultimate summer adventure.	<p><!--StartFragment --></p>\n<p><span class="cf0">Experience the magic of South Africa this February with our Cape Town &amp; Garden Route Escape. Soak in the warmth of summer as you explore the vibrant city of Cape Town, from the breathtaking heights of Table Mountain to the dramatic views at Cape Point. Wander through the colorful streets of </span><span class="cf0">Bo-Kaap</span><span class="cf0">, visit the charming Penguin Colony at Boulders Beach, and enjoy world-class wine tasting in the Cape Winelands. Continue your journey along the scenic Garden Route, known for its pristine beaches, lush forests, and wildlife encounters. With perfect weather, stunning landscapes, and endless adventure, this trip offers the ultimate South African experience.</span></p>\n<p><!--EndFragment --></p>	25	1	1500	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	cape-town-garden-route-escape	t	f	a51bee8b-9466-40b2-3e3c-604f5a7c9f01	2025-11-13 20:22:11.128229+00	2025-11-13 20:22:11.128229+00	\N	\N
9	Mombasa Beach & Diani Vibes	Escape to Mombasa & Diani this March! Enjoy beaches, Fort Jesus, Wasini Island & a Tamarind Dhow cruise for the perfect coastal getaway.	<p>Experience the ultimate coastal escape this March with our Mombasa Beach and Diani Vibes Holiday Package. Discover the enchanting beauty of Kenya&rsquo;s coastline before the long rains begin &mdash; when the sun is warm, the skies are clear, and the ocean shimmers in turquoise perfection. Immerse yourself in the rich history of Fort Jesus, explore the white sands of Diani Beach, and sail away on a romantic Tamarind Dhow Dinner Cruise under the stars. Don&rsquo;t miss a day trip to the stunning Wasini Island, home to dolphins, coral gardens, and authentic Swahili culture. Whether you crave adventure or pure relaxation, this Mombasa and Diani package offers the perfect blend of tropical charm, culture, and seaside bliss. Book your Kenya beach holiday from 15th&ndash;20th March and indulge in sun-kissed days, magical sunsets, and unforgettable coastal memories along the Indian Ocean.</p>	1	1	1200	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	mombasa-beach-diani-vibes	t	f	a77fb4b4-45dd-45e2-fc96-d33a9547a201	2025-11-13 20:29:08.475689+00	2025-11-13 20:29:08.475689+00	\N	\N
10	Egypt History & Nile Cruise	Explore Egypt this April! Visit the Pyramids, Egyptian Museum, Luxor Temples, and enjoy a luxury Nile Cruise for an unforgettable adventure.	<p>Step into the timeless world of ancient Egypt this April with our Egypt History &amp; Nile Cruise Holiday Package. Perfectly timed for moderate spring weather and the Easter holidays (6th&ndash;12th April), this journey combines culture, history, and luxury. Begin in Cairo, marvel at the Pyramids of Giza, explore the treasures of the Egyptian Museum, and soak in the vibrant city atmosphere. Then, embark on a luxurious Nile Cruise, gliding past iconic landscapes and ancient temples, before arriving in Luxor, home to the awe-inspiring Karnak and Luxor Temples. This Egypt travel package offers the ultimate mix of adventure, relaxation, and cultural immersion, perfect for history enthusiasts and leisure travelers alike. Experience the mystique of pharaohs, the grandeur of ancient monuments, and the serenity of the Nile. Book now for an unforgettable Egyptian adventure that combines iconic landmarks, luxury cruising, and lifelong memories.</p>	5	1	1750	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	egypt-history-nile-cruise	t	f	6ffafe72-8e46-47f7-c0c3-29aaf0aa8301	2025-11-13 20:34:13.511862+00	2025-11-13 20:34:13.511862+00	\N	\N
