1	Travel To Namanga	Recuring monthly travel to Namanga	<p>Updated travel to Namanga</p>	1	1	3000	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	travel-to-namanga	f	f	02120707-b021-4050-a742-844285f07501	2025-09-30 17:52:07.905936+00	2025-11-04 11:55:27.956276+00	\N	\N
3	Rotary Taipei 2026 - Exclusive Package 	Join Rotarians from East Africa at Rotary Taipei 2026, 13–17 June! Travel stress-free with Allbound Vacations’ all-inclusive 8-night package: flights, hotel, transfers, visa, support & curated tours. Secure your spot today!	<p>Join fellow Rotarians from Uganda, Kenya, and across East Africa for an inspiring experience at the Rotary International Convention in Taipei, Taiwan &mdash; 13 to 17 June 2026. This global gathering brings together thousands of changemakers, innovators, and leaders for a week of learning, networking, and cultural exchange.</p>\n<p>At Allbound Vacations, we&rsquo;ve designed an exclusive 8-night travel package that makes attending Rotary Taipei 2026 effortless and unforgettable. Our packages include return flights from Uganda and Kenya, premium hotel accommodation near the convention center, airport and local transfers, visa assistance, and on-the-ground support throughout your stay.</p>\n<p>Enhance your journey with pre- and post-convention tours and excursions &mdash; explore Taipei&rsquo;s world-famous night markets, temples, and skyline, or extend your stay to experience Taiwan&rsquo;s serene mountains, hot springs, and coastal beauty.</p>\n<p>With competitive airfares, group-friendly hotel rates, and a dedicated support team, Allbound Vacations ensures your Rotary experience is seamless from takeoff to touchdown. Whether you&rsquo;re a Rotarian, club leader, or accompanying family member, we provide everything you need &mdash; from conference logistics to curated cultural experiences &mdash; all in one professionally managed package.</p>\n<p>Reserve your spot early for Taipei 2026 and travel with confidence knowing Allbound Vacations &mdash; East Africa&rsquo;s trusted outbound travel specialist &mdash; has you covered every step of the way</p>	10	1	2500	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	rotary-taipei-2026-exclusive-package	t	f	dc15eabe-a579-4823-e842-9a5b572fbb01	2025-10-29 22:17:47.326351+00	2025-11-13 19:08:14.298506+00	\N	\N
2	Girls Trip: Singapore  and  Malaysia	Join Allbound Vacations for the ultimate Girls’ Getaway to Singapore & Malaysia this July!	<p>Pack your bags, gather your girls, and get ready to live your best life this July!<br>Allbound Vacations presents the ultimate Girls&rsquo; Getaway to Singapore and Malaysia &mdash; a journey filled with tropical luxury, laughter, and unforgettable moments in two of Asia&rsquo;s most dazzling cities.</p>\n<p>From futuristic skylines and sunset cocktails in Singapore, to colorful markets and rooftop glam in Kuala Lumpur, this 9-day escape is all about celebrating sisterhood, style, and soul &mdash; with a perfect blend of sightseeing, shopping, and self-care.</p>	3	1	894.99	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	girls-trip-singapore-and-malaysia	t	t	d3900eaa-5774-426f-eb33-01ea99bd2a01	2025-10-20 20:15:18.743131+00	2026-02-04 00:33:37.091928+00	\N	\N
11	Zanzibar Island Getaway	Discover Zanzibar this May! Explore Stone Town, relax on Nungwi Beach, enjoy Safari Blue, and visit Prison Island for the ultimate island getaway.	<p>Escape to paradise this May with our <strong data-start="74" data-end="101">Zanzibar Island Getaway</strong>, the perfect blend of <strong data-start="124" data-end="162">beach bliss and cultural discovery</strong>. Timed at the <strong data-start="177" data-end="197">end of the rains</strong>, enjoy fewer crowds, clear skies, and warm, inviting waters along the <strong data-start="268" data-end="284">Indian Ocean</strong>. Explore the historic charm of <strong data-start="316" data-end="330">Stone Town</strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage site, with its winding streets, vibrant markets, and rich Swahili culture. Relax on the pristine white sands of <strong data-start="468" data-end="484">Nungwi Beach</strong>, or embark on the <strong data-start="503" data-end="528">Safari Blue adventure</strong>, where snorkeling, dhow sailing, and marine encounters create unforgettable memories. Visit <strong data-start="621" data-end="638">Prison Island</strong> and meet the giant tortoises while soaking in the island&rsquo;s history and natural beauty. This <strong data-start="731" data-end="759">Zanzibar holiday package</strong> is perfect for travelers seeking sun, sea, and authentic experiences. Book your <strong data-start="840" data-end="865">24th&ndash;29th May getaway</strong> and immerse yourself in Zanzibar&rsquo;s tropical charm, breathtaking beaches, and vibrant culture for an unforgettable escape.</p>	6	1	1350	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	zanzibar-island-getaway	t	f	bbd91e2f-97f4-4654-31c3-cb9d3188c601	2025-11-13 21:13:46.495079+00	2025-11-13 21:13:46.495079+00	\N	\N
12	Mauritius Tropical Escape	Escape to Mauritius this July! Explore Port Louis, Chamarel Waterfalls, Grand Baie, and enjoy a romantic catamaran cruise for the perfect tropical getaway.	<p>Indulge in a Mauritius Tropical Escape this July, the perfect honeymooners&rsquo; paradise and luxury getaway. Set during the cool and dry season, enjoy ideal conditions for outdoor adventures, sightseeing, and beach relaxation. Explore the vibrant capital, Port Louis, with its bustling markets and cultural charm. Marvel at the natural beauty of Chamarel Waterfalls and the nearby Seven Colored Earths, a true geological wonder. Sail the turquoise waters on a romantic catamaran cruise, or unwind on the pristine beaches of Grand Baie, where sun, sand, and sea meet. This Mauritius holiday package offers a perfect mix of adventure, romance, and relaxation, making it an ideal escape for couples seeking an unforgettable tropical experience. From scenic landscapes to luxurious experiences, Mauritius promises memories that last a lifetime. Book your 14th&ndash;21st July escape and immerse yourself in the ultimate island paradise.</p>	7	1	2500	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	mauritius-tropical-escape	t	f	645ac2f9-6c4a-487e-8898-3d83b5b91601	2025-11-13 21:25:02.694015+00	2025-11-13 21:25:02.694015+00	\N	\N
7	Dubai New Year Getaway	Celebrate the New Year in style with our Dubai getaway—desert safari, Burj Khalifa, Dhow cruise, shopping & Global Village fun!	<p>Kick off the year in style with our Dubai New Year Getaway, the ultimate holiday experience for adventure seekers and luxury lovers alike. From 3rd to 8th January, escape to the glittering city of Dubai, UAE, where cool winter temperatures set the perfect stage for unforgettable experiences. Shop till you drop at the Dubai Mall, witness breathtaking views from the Burj Khalifa, and cruise under the stars along the Dubai Marina on a traditional Dhow Cruise.Embark on a thrilling Desert Safari, enjoy a magical evening at Global Village, and soak in the city&rsquo;s futuristic skyline and golden sands. Whether you&rsquo;re celebrating new beginnings or craving a midwinter escape, Allbound Vacations ensures a seamless, stylish, and adventure-filled getaway.</p>	3	1	1350	\N	10	\N	\N	\N	dubai-new-year-getaway	t	f	d41973ba-c4f6-4cce-73b6-cbed3f268201	2025-11-13 20:07:57.165272+00	2026-02-18 19:24:01.555588+00	\N	\N
