COPY public.holiday_types (id, name, description, slug, image_id, icon, is_active, created_at, updated_at, order_index) FROM stdin;
1	Safaris	Experience the thrill of Africa’s wild beauty with Allbound Vacations Safaris — your gateway to unforgettable wildlife adventures. Our expertly crafted African safari holidays take you deep into iconic destinations like Uganda, Kenya, Tanzania, and Rwanda, home to the Big Five and breathtaking landscapes. From gorilla trekking in Bwindi Impenetrable Forest to game drives in the Maasai Mara and Serengeti, every journey offers a front-row seat to nature’s greatest spectacle.\n\nStay in handpicked lodges and luxury tented camps that blend comfort with authentic African charm. Whether you seek a luxury safari, family adventure, or romantic wilderness escape, Allbound Vacations tailors each experience to your style. Discover Africa’s rich cultures, golden savannahs, and dramatic sunsets — a world where every moment feels alive.\n\nBook your East African safari holiday today and let Allbound Vacations turn your wildlife dreams into lifelong memories.	hicking	d35784ae-0839-402a-43e4-8853d3e2c301	🦁	f	2025-09-30 13:00:47.206191+00	2025-11-19 20:16:06.29928+00	\N
5	Luxury Holidays	Experience the art of indulgence with Luxury Holidays by Allbound Vacations, where every moment is crafted to perfection. Our exclusive luxury holiday packages connect discerning travelers to the world’s most elegant destinations — from the overwater villas of Maldives and the private beaches of Seychelles, to the cosmopolitan charm of Dubai, Paris, and Cape Town.\n\nEnjoy private transfers, five-star resorts, fine dining, personal butlers, and curated experiences that redefine sophistication. Whether it’s a luxury safari in Africa, a romantic escape, or a tailor-made city getaway, we deliver exceptional comfort, privacy, and style at every step.\n\nAt Allbound Vacations, we don’t just plan trips — we design unforgettable journeys that speak luxury in every detail. Discover our world of premium travel experiences and let us turn your dream holiday into a masterpiece.	luxury-holidays	aa6c1fac-c020-4421-c77a-5792a0194701	🍽️	t	2025-10-08 23:27:40.364616+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	4
2	Cruise Holidays	Set sail on a journey of luxury, discovery, and relaxation with Cruise Holidays by Allbound Vacations — your gateway to the world’s most breathtaking destinations by sea. Whether you dream of gliding through the Mediterranean, exploring the Caribbean’s turquoise islands, or discovering the fjords of Northern Europe, we design tailor-made cruise experiences that redefine travel.\n\nOur cruise packages include world-class accommodations, fine dining, entertainment, and guided shore excursions — all seamlessly arranged to create an effortless voyage. From romantic sunset sails to family-friendly adventures and luxury ocean crossings, every journey offers the perfect blend of comfort, culture, and adventure.\n\nWith Allbound Vacations, every port unveils a new story and every wave carries a promise of unforgettable moments. Because with us, it’s more than a cruise — it’s the voyage of a lifetime.	safari	4db8f1bc-e87b-4e92-6e19-c66d65ea8501	🚢	t	2025-09-30 17:38:44.49649+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	6
8	Sports Travel	Experience the thrill of the world’s greatest sporting events with Sports Travel by Allbound Vacations — your gateway to exclusive, tailor-made sports holidays. Whether you’re chasing the excitement of Formula One Grand Prix races or teeing off on world-class golf courses in destinations like Dubai, Mauritius, or South Africa, we design unforgettable experiences that put you right at the heart of the action.\n\nOur sports travel packages include premium event tickets, luxury accommodation, private transfers, and curated leisure activities, ensuring a seamless balance of sport, relaxation, and exploration. From witnessing the speed and glamour of F1 circuits to enjoying championship golf under the tropics, Allbound Vacations transforms passion into a perfectly planned adventure.\n\nJoin fans and players alike in global sporting destinations — because with us, it’s more than travel; it’s living the sport.	sports-travel	09e06346-f685-4c29-8396-4ad088e33001	🏈	t	2025-10-10 07:06:38.233585+00	2026-02-20 17:08:21.815232+00	12
9	Multi-Centre Holidays	Discover the world your way with Multi-Centre Holidays by Allbound Vacations — the perfect choice for travellers who want more than just one destination. Experience the best of multiple cities or countries in a single journey, combining vibrant cultures, diverse landscapes, and unique adventures all in one seamless itinerary.\n\nWhether you dream of pairing Dubai’s modern luxury with the beaches of Mauritius, exploring Europe’s iconic capitals, or mixing African safaris with island relaxation, we craft personalised routes that maximise your time and enrich every moment.\n\nOur tailor-made multi-centre packages include inter-destination transfers, luxury stays, guided tours, and curated experiences, ensuring a smooth, unforgettable journey from start to finish.\n\nWith Allbound Vacations, every stop is a new story — because the world is too beautiful to visit just one place.\n	multi-centre-holidays	2ccb523d-3f39-4105-4051-d4f959918301	🗺️	t	2025-10-10 09:17:18.597588+00	2026-02-20 17:08:21.815232+00	10
11	Religious Tours	Embark on a journey of faith and reflection with Religious Tours by Allbound Vacations — your gateway to spiritually enriching pilgrimages across the world’s most sacred destinations. Whether you’re tracing biblical footsteps in Israel, visiting the Vatican in Rome, exploring Islamic heritage in Mecca and Medina, or discovering ancient temples in Egypt and India, we curate soul-stirring experiences that deepen your spiritual connection.\n\nOur religious tour packages include guided pilgrimages, comfortable accommodations, seamless transfers, and dedicated on-ground support — ensuring peace of mind and comfort throughout your journey. Each experience is thoughtfully designed to combine devotion, culture, and community, allowing travelers to renew their faith while exploring the beauty of the world.\n\nAt Allbound Vacations, we don’t just take you to holy places — we guide you on a sacred journey of the heart.	religious-tours	51e98b51-8165-4e5c-e245-581e5cb38501	📖	t	2025-10-10 21:37:23.001856+00	2026-02-20 17:08:21.815232+00	11
3	Beach Holidays	Escape to paradise with Allbound Vacations’ unforgettable beach holidays. Feel the golden sands under your feet and the warm sun on your skin as you explore the world’s most stunning coastal destinations. From the turquoise waters and spice-scented breezes of Zanzibar, to the vibrant culture and endless beaches along the Kenyan coast, every moment is a tropical dream. Indulge in luxury and romance in the idyllic islands of Mauritius and Seychelles, or experience unrivaled exclusivity with overwater villas in the Maldives. Whether you crave thrilling water sports, serene relaxation, or romantic sunset strolls, our curated beach escapes promise memories that last a lifetime. With Allbound Vacations, every beach holiday is seamless, luxurious, and unforgettable. Start your journey to the world’s most breathtaking shores and let the waves of adventure sweep you away.	beach-holidays	4ba653c4-152b-42c9-f2c6-db27bc9b7f01	🏖️	t	2025-10-06 23:43:17.358729+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	1
4	Honeymoons	Begin your forever with an unforgettable honeymoon holiday crafted by Allbound Vacations — where love meets luxury. From the sun-kissed beaches of Maldives, Mauritius, and Zanzibar to the romantic cityscapes of Paris, Dubai, and Rome, we design bespoke honeymoon packages that celebrate your unique love story.\n\nIndulge in candlelit dinners by the ocean, sunset cruises, private pool villas, and breathtaking island views — every detail perfectly planned for intimacy and relaxation. Whether you dream of a tropical honeymoon, a luxury escape, or an adventurous getaway, our expert team ensures your first journey as a couple is seamless and unforgettable.\n\nLet the world’s most romantic destinations set the stage for memories that last a lifetime. Discover honeymoon deals to the world with Allbound Vacations — where your happily ever after begins.	honeymoons	4a1f4fdd-2765-4ddf-db79-c49f409c9301	💑	t	2025-10-08 23:23:36.676976+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	3
6	Family Holidays	Create unforgettable memories with Family Holidays by Allbound Vacations, where fun, relaxation, and bonding come together effortlessly. Our family-friendly holiday packages are designed for travelers of all ages — from parents seeking comfort to kids craving adventure.\n\nWhether you’re exploring the wildlife of Kenya, relaxing on the beaches of Zanzibar, discovering the magic of Dubai, or enjoying theme parks in Singapore, we ensure a seamless experience filled with comfort, safety, and excitement.\n\nStay in family resorts with spacious rooms, child-friendly facilities, and activities for everyone — from beach games to city tours and safaris. Every itinerary is thoughtfully planned to balance adventure with downtime, so every member of the family feels included.\n\nWith Allbound Vacations, your family holiday becomes more than a trip — it’s a shared story of joy, laughter, and discovery across the world’s best destinations.	family-holidays	9b8a9ba2-7b15-4920-9157-97cba2100101	👨‍👩‍👦	t	2025-10-08 23:34:13.302476+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	2
7	Incentives and Conferences	Reward success and inspire excellence with Incentive Trips by Allbound Vacations, your trusted partner for unforgettable corporate travel experiences. We design motivational travel programs that celebrate achievement, boost team morale, and strengthen business relationships — all in world-class destinations.\n\nFrom luxury beach resorts in Mauritius and Zanzibar to city adventures in Dubai or Cape Town, our tailor-made corporate incentive packages combine relaxation, adventure, and cultural discovery. Each program is customized to reflect your company’s values and goals, offering seamless planning that covers accommodation, activities, gala dinners, and team-building events.\n\nWhether it’s rewarding top performers or hosting executive retreats, Allbound Vacations ensures a smooth, memorable experience that leaves your team inspired and appreciated. Let travel become your company’s most powerful motivation tool — turning recognition into an unforgettable journey of celebration and success.	incentives-and-conferences	25d57e94-1f87-4ec6-fa14-a29c21da7901	🍾	t	2025-10-08 23:38:26.509948+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	9
10	Educational Trips	Inspire young minds and broaden horizons with Educational Trips by Allbound Vacations — your trusted partner in creating immersive, tailor-made learning experiences across the globe. Whether it’s a school expedition to historical landmarks in Egypt, a science discovery tour in Singapore, or a cultural exchange program in Europe, we design journeys that blend education with exploration.\n\nOur educational travel packages include flights, comfortable accommodations, guided tours, meals, and dedicated on-ground support — ensuring safety, enrichment, and seamless organization from start to finish. Students gain practical insights, global exposure, and unforgettable memories that go beyond the classroom.\n\nAt Allbound Vacations, we believe learning is best experienced, not just taught. Because with us, it’s more than travel — it’s education that inspires.	educational-trips	d6a43200-3d3c-4489-df71-a011e5432a01	🎓	t	2025-10-10 10:00:15.015128+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	8
12	City Break	At Allbound Holidays, our City Breaks are designed for travelers who want big experiences in a short amount of time. Perfect for weekend escapes, business add-ons, or quick holiday adventures, our city break packages take you straight into the heart of the world’s most exciting destinations. From Dubai’s skyscrapers, Cairo’s ancient wonders, and Cape Town’s coastal charm, to Istanbul’s culture, Paris’s romance, and Singapore’s modern beauty, we curate seamless short trips that deliver maximum enjoyment with minimal planning.\n\nEach Allbound Holidays city break includes handpicked hotels, airport transfers, guided tours, and flexible add-ons to help you explore iconic landmarks, top attractions, local cuisine, shopping districts, and vibrant nightlife. Whether you’re traveling solo, as a couple, or with friends, our expertly crafted itineraries ensure convenience, comfort, and unforgettable memories.	city-break	a87bda42-a934-4367-e1a0-03cf7438dc01	🏛️	t	2025-11-17 16:51:06.992465+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	5
13	Destination Weddings	Turn your dream wedding into an unforgettable celebration with Allbound Vacations’ Signature Destination Wedding Experiences. Whether you desire a barefoot ceremony on pristine white-sand beaches, a luxurious cliff-top vow exchange, or an elegant resort wedding surrounded by crystal-blue waters, we design breathtaking weddings in the world’s most romantic destinations. Our dedicated wedding specialists manage every detail—venue selection, décor styling, legal requirements, guest travel, airport transfers, accommodation, photography, entertainment, and reception planning—ensuring a seamless, stress-free celebration crafted around your unique vision.\n\nAllbound Vacations proudly specializes in Zanzibar beach weddings, Dubai luxury weddings, Mauritius island weddings, Mombasa coastal weddings, and exclusive honeymoon escapes across Africa, the Middle East, and the Indian Ocean. With premium venues, trusted global partners, and custom wedding packages, we deliver flawless coordination and exceptional hospitality. Your special day deserves perfection, and we ensure it becomes a timeless, cherished memory for you and your loved ones.	destination-weddings	75164efc-b847-422b-9cf9-69c55b782a01	💍	t	2025-11-19 19:49:19.630517+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	7
14	African Safaris	Discover Allbound Vacations, your premier luxury safari specialist offering unforgettable African safari experiences across Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Rwanda, South Africa, Botswana, Namibia, Zambia, Malawi, and Zimbabwe. We combine world-class service with expertly curated itineraries to deliver the best African safari holidays tailored to your travel dreams. From witnessing the Great Migration in the Serengeti, trekking mountain gorillas in Bwindi Forest, exploring the Okavango Delta, or marveling at Victoria Falls, our safaris showcase Africa’s most iconic wildlife destinations.\n\nAt Allbound Vacations, we provide handpicked luxury lodges, seamless ground handling, and personalized travel planning backed by deep regional expertise. Our tailor-made safari packages cater to families, honeymooners, adventure seekers, and groups, ensuring every traveler enjoys a unique, immersive journey. For multi-country safaris, our strong partnerships across Africa guarantee smooth, worry-free travel.\n\nChoose Allbound Vacations for the ultimate African safari experience, crafted with excellence, comfort, and authenticity.	african-safaris	bde6067a-b452-41d9-5202-06cbd0e27501	🦁	t	2025-11-19 20:15:59.413744+00	2026-02-22 10:57:38.055863+00	0
