COPY public.hotel_types (id, name, description, slug, is_active, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
3	Airport Hotel	An Airport Hotel offers convenient accommodation located within or near an airport, designed primarily for travelers in transit, early departures, or late arrivals. These hotels provide quick access to airport terminals, complimentary shuttle services, and flexible check-in/check-out times. Guests enjoy modern amenities such as soundproof rooms, high-speed Wi-Fi, restaurants, meeting facilities, and fitness centers, ensuring comfort and productivity between flights. Ideal for business travelers, flight crews, and passengers with layovers, airport hotels combine convenience with efficiency, allowing guests to rest, refresh, or work without the hassle of long transfers.	airport-hotel	t	2025-10-11 19:03:27.292584+00	2025-10-11 19:03:27.292584+00
4	Jungle Lodge 	A Jungle Lodge offers an immersive escape deep within nature, surrounded by lush rainforests, exotic wildlife, and the soothing sounds of the wild. These lodges are designed for travelers seeking adventure and tranquility in equal measure. Guests can enjoy guided nature walks, birdwatching, and wildlife safaris, all while staying in eco-friendly accommodation that blends seamlessly with the natural environment. With features like open-air dining, natural pools, and sustainable amenities, jungle lodges provide an authentic yet comfortable experience. Ideal for nature lovers, photographers, and explorers, they offer a serene retreat into the heart of the wilderness.	jungle-lodge	t	2025-10-11 19:24:25.888096+00	2025-10-11 19:24:25.888096+00
5	Beach Resort	A Beach Resort offers the perfect blend of relaxation, luxury, and oceanfront adventure, located along pristine coastlines with direct access to sandy beaches and turquoise waters. Designed for leisure seekers, couples, and families, beach resorts provide spacious rooms or villas with stunning sea views, multiple dining options, swimming pools, and wellness spas. Guests can indulge in water sports such as snorkeling, jet skiing, or sailing, or simply unwind under palm trees with a refreshing drink in hand. With sunset dinners, beachfront entertainment, and world-class service, beach resorts deliver the ultimate tropical escape filled with sun, sea, and serenity.	beach-resort	t	2025-10-11 20:04:29.108164+00	2025-10-11 20:04:29.108164+00
6	Safari Lodge	A Safari Lodge offers an authentic wilderness experience set within or near national parks and game reserves, blending comfort with adventure in the heart of nature. These lodges feature elegant rooms or tented suites designed to harmonize with the natural surroundings while providing modern comforts such as en-suite bathrooms, private decks, and panoramic views. Guests enjoy guided game drives, bush walks, and cultural interactions led by expert rangers. With cozy lounges, outdoor dining areas, and campfire evenings under star-lit skies, safari lodges provide an immersive retreat where wildlife encounters and serenity meet in perfect harmony.	safari-lodge	t	2025-10-11 20:06:11.59591+00	2025-10-11 20:06:11.59591+00
7	Tented Camp	A Tented Camp offers a unique blend of adventure and comfort, providing guests with an authentic safari experience close to nature. Set in remote wilderness areas or national parks, these camps feature spacious canvas tents equipped with cozy beds, private bathrooms, and verandas overlooking scenic landscapes. Despite their rustic charm, tented camps often include amenities such as fine dining, campfire lounges, and personalized service. Guests can enjoy guided game drives, nature walks, and starlit evenings surrounded by the sounds of the wild. Perfect for travelers seeking intimacy, serenity, and a true connection with Africa’s untamed beauty.	tented-camp	t	2025-10-11 20:07:38.17073+00	2025-10-11 20:07:38.17073+00
2	Main Type	Description	main-type	f	2025-09-30 17:57:00.704276+00	2025-10-11 20:07:55.456955+00
1	Mid Level	Midlevel hotel type	mid-level	f	2025-09-30 13:02:10.128623+00	2025-10-11 20:07:58.298954+00
8	Golf Resort 	A Golf Resort offers a perfect blend of leisure, luxury, and sport, centered around world-class golf courses set in breathtaking natural surroundings. Designed for golfers and relaxation seekers alike, these resorts feature beautifully landscaped fairways, professional coaching, and modern clubhouses. Guests enjoy elegant accommodations, fine dining, spa treatments, and a wide range of recreational activities beyond the greens. Whether you’re teeing off at sunrise or unwinding by the pool after a round, every detail is tailored for comfort and sophistication. Ideal for couples, families, and corporate retreats, golf resorts combine sport, serenity, and style in one unforgettable stay	golf-resort	t	2025-10-11 20:09:33.260595+00	2025-10-11 20:09:33.260595+00
9	City Hotel	A City Hotel offers stylish and convenient accommodation located in the heart of vibrant urban centers, ideal for business and leisure travelers alike. Positioned close to key attractions, shopping districts, business hubs, and entertainment venues, city hotels provide easy access to everything the city has to offer. Guests enjoy modern rooms with contemporary décor, high-speed Wi-Fi, restaurants, meeting facilities, and fitness centers. Whether for a short city break, a business trip, or a cultural getaway, city hotels blend comfort, convenience, and connectivity, allowing guests to experience the pulse of the city while enjoying exceptional hospitality and service.	city-hotel	t	2025-10-11 20:11:07.274214+00	2025-10-11 20:11:07.274214+00
10	Mountain Resort	A Mountain Resort offers a serene escape set amidst breathtaking highland landscapes, perfect for travelers seeking relaxation, adventure, and natural beauty. Nestled in scenic mountain ranges, these resorts provide comfortable accommodation with stunning views, fresh air, and a peaceful atmosphere. Guests can enjoy activities such as hiking, nature walks, birdwatching, and bonfire evenings, along with spa treatments and fine dining. Many mountain resorts feature cozy lodges, fireplaces, and wellness facilities that blend seamlessly with the natural environment. Ideal for couples, families, or groups, mountain resorts promise rejuvenation and adventure surrounded by majestic peaks and tranquility.	mountain-resort	t	2025-10-11 20:13:01.382426+00	2025-10-11 20:13:01.382426+00
11	Guest House	A Guest House offers a warm, homely atmosphere with personalized hospitality, ideal for travelers seeking comfort and authenticity at an affordable rate. Typically smaller than hotels, guest houses provide cozy rooms, home-cooked meals, and a welcoming environment that feels like staying with family. Guests can enjoy shared lounges, gardens, and common areas perfect for relaxation and social interaction. Whether located in the city, countryside, or near tourist attractions, guest houses offer genuine local charm and attentive service. Ideal for solo travelers, couples, and small groups, they combine comfort, value, and cultural connection in one inviting stay.	guest-house	t	2025-10-11 20:14:58.408571+00	2025-10-11 20:14:58.408571+00
12	Bush Camp	A Bush Camp offers an immersive wilderness experience, allowing guests to connect with nature while enjoying comfortable accommodations in the heart of the bush. Typically set within or near national parks and wildlife reserves, bush camps provide tented or cabin-style lodging, often with en-suite facilities, cozy bedding, and shaded outdoor spaces. Guests can enjoy guided game drives, bush walks, sundowners, and wildlife spotting right from the camp. With meals prepared on-site and attentive staff ensuring a seamless stay, bush camps combine adventure, relaxation, and authentic safari living. Ideal for nature lovers, photographers, and adventure seekers looking for a genuine African wilderness experience.	bush-camp	t	2025-10-11 20:17:07.815094+00	2025-10-11 20:17:07.815094+00
13	Conference Hotel	A Conference Hotel provides purpose-built accommodation and facilities for business events, meetings, and corporate gatherings. Strategically located in city centers or near airports, these hotels offer fully equipped conference rooms, boardrooms, and auditoriums with advanced AV technology, high-speed Wi-Fi, and professional support staff. Guests enjoy comfortable rooms, on-site dining, catering services, and leisure amenities such as fitness centers and lounges. Ideal for business travelers, corporate delegates, and event organizers, conference hotels combine productivity, convenience, and comfort, ensuring seamless meetings, workshops, and networking opportunities all under one roof.	conference-hotel	t	2025-10-11 20:46:00.4639+00	2025-10-11 20:46:00.4639+00
20	Beach Villa	A Beach Villa offers luxurious, private accommodation located along pristine coastlines, designed for ultimate relaxation and leisure. Each villa typically includes spacious bedrooms, living areas, private pools, outdoor terraces, and direct beach access, allowing guests to enjoy sun, sea, and sand in complete privacy. Modern amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi, fully equipped kitchens, air conditioning, and concierge services ensure comfort and convenience. Ideal for families, couples, or groups seeking a serene getaway, beach villas combine the charm of coastal living with luxury, privacy, and personalized service, creating an unforgettable seaside retreat.	beach-villa	t	2025-10-11 20:57:59.112387+00	2025-10-11 20:57:59.112387+00
14	Mobile Safari Camp	A Mobile Safari Camp offers flexible, luxury accommodations that move with the wildlife and seasons, providing an immersive African safari experience. These camps are set up in prime wilderness locations and feature tented suites or luxury tents with comfortable bedding, private bathrooms, and en-suite amenities. Guests enjoy guided game drives, bush dining, sundowners, and wildlife viewing directly from the camp. Designed for adventure seekers and nature enthusiasts, mobile safari camps combine comfort, exclusivity, and close encounters with nature, allowing travelers to explore remote landscapes and wildlife habitats while enjoying the convenience and personalized service of a temporary but well-equipped lodge.	mobile-safari-camp	t	2025-10-11 20:48:16.303906+00	2025-10-11 20:48:16.303906+00
18	Hotel Apartment	A Hotel Apartment offers the comfort of home combined with the services of a hotel, providing fully furnished units with kitchens, living areas, and private bathrooms. Ideal for extended stays, families, or business travelers, hotel apartments allow guests to cook, relax, and work in a spacious, self-contained environment. Guests also enjoy modern amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi, laundry facilities, housekeeping, and access to on-site restaurants or fitness centers. Perfect for travelers seeking flexibility, independence, and convenience, hotel apartments provide a home-away-from-home experience while ensuring comfort, security, and professional services throughout the stay.	hotel-apartment	t	2025-10-11 20:56:10.217458+00	2025-10-11 20:56:10.217458+00
15	Eco Lodge	An Eco-Lodge offers sustainable and environmentally friendly accommodation, often set in pristine natural surroundings. These lodges focus on minimizing ecological impact while providing comfort, featuring solar power, rainwater harvesting, locally sourced materials, and eco-conscious practices. Guests enjoy immersive experiences such as guided nature walks, wildlife observation, and conservation activities. Eco-lodges combine rustic charm with modern amenities like comfortable rooms, Wi-Fi, and healthy, locally inspired meals. Ideal for nature lovers, conservationists, and travelers seeking a responsible and authentic connection with the environment, eco-lodges provide a serene retreat that harmonizes comfort with ecological stewardship.	eco-lodge	t	2025-10-11 20:50:50.981846+00	2025-10-11 20:50:50.981846+00
17	Boutique Hotel	A Boutique Hotel offers an intimate and stylish lodging experience, characterized by personalized service, unique design, and attention to detail. Typically smaller than standard hotels, boutique hotels provide individually decorated rooms, cozy common areas, and curated amenities such as gourmet dining, artisanal coffee, or wellness facilities. Perfect for travelers seeking charm, comfort, and a distinctive atmosphere, these hotels often reflect the local culture and lifestyle. Ideal for couples, business travelers, or leisure guests, boutique hotels combine exclusivity, character, and convenience to deliver a memorable stay with personalized attention at every turn.	boutique-hotel	t	2025-10-11 20:54:51.396981+00	2025-10-11 20:54:51.396981+00
16	Luxury Tented Camp 	A Luxury Tented Camp offers an upscale safari experience combining the adventure of camping with the comfort and elegance of a five-star lodge. Guests stay in spacious, beautifully furnished tents with en-suite bathrooms, plush bedding, private decks, and sometimes plunge pools. The camps provide gourmet dining, attentive service, and guided wildlife safaris or nature walks. Set in prime wilderness locations, they allow close encounters with wildlife while maintaining privacy and luxury. Ideal for discerning travelers seeking adventure without sacrificing comfort, luxury tented camps deliver an unforgettable blend of nature, exclusivity, and world-class hospitality	luxury-tented-camp	t	2025-10-11 20:53:02.934352+00	2025-10-11 20:53:02.934352+00
19	Apartment	An Apartment offers fully furnished living spaces designed for comfort, independence, and extended stays. Each unit typically includes a bedroom, living area, kitchen, and private bathroom, allowing guests to cook, relax, and work at their own pace. Apartments provide modern amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi, laundry facilities, and access to fitness centers or communal spaces. Ideal for families, business travelers, or long-term guests, apartments combine the convenience of self-catering with the security and services of a professionally managed property, giving travelers a flexible and comfortable home-away-from-home experience.	apartment	t	2025-10-11 20:57:06.135441+00	2025-10-11 20:57:06.135441+00
23	Hostel	A Hostel provides budget-friendly accommodation ideal for travelers seeking affordable, social, and flexible lodging. Typically offering dormitory-style rooms or private rooms, hostels include shared kitchens, common lounges, and communal bathrooms. Guests benefit from high-speed Wi-Fi, secure storage, and often organized activities or tours to connect with other travelers. Perfect for backpackers, students, and solo adventurers, hostels combine convenience with community, creating a lively, welcoming environment. They allow guests to rest, refresh, and plan their travels efficiently, all while keeping costs low and offering opportunities to meet fellow explorers from around the world.	hostel	t	2025-10-11 21:03:21.014941+00	2025-10-11 21:03:21.014941+00
21	All-Inclusive Resort	An All-Inclusive Resort offers a comprehensive vacation experience where accommodation, meals, drinks, and many activities are bundled into one package. Guests enjoy spacious rooms or suites, multiple dining options, bars, pools, entertainment, and recreational facilities such as water sports, fitness centers, and kids’ clubs. Ideal for families, couples, or groups seeking a hassle-free holiday, all-inclusive resorts combine comfort, convenience, and luxury. Guests can relax, dine, and enjoy a wide array of activities without worrying about extra costs, making it a perfect choice for those who want to maximize their leisure time and experience a seamless, indulgent getaway.	all-inclusive-resort	t	2025-10-11 20:59:41.513537+00	2025-10-11 20:59:41.513537+00
22	Country Lodge	A Country Lodge offers a serene retreat nestled in the countryside, ideal for travelers seeking relaxation, nature, and a slower pace. Guests enjoy cozy rooms or cottages, hearty local cuisine, outdoor terraces, gardens, and leisure facilities such as walking trails, fishing spots, and lounges. Perfect for families, couples, or solo travelers, country lodges combine rustic charm with modern comforts, providing a peaceful escape from city life. Guests can unwind, connect with nature, and enjoy personalized hospitality while experiencing the local culture and surroundings, making it an ideal choice for a restorative getaway in a scenic rural setting.	country-lodge	t	2025-10-11 21:02:22.718615+00	2025-10-11 21:02:22.718615+00
\.
