7	Hilton Seychelles Northolme Resort & Spa	<p>Escape to Hilton Seychelles Northolme Resort &amp; Spa &mdash; private oceanfront villas, infinity pool, spa bliss, and unforgettable romantic island luxury.</p>	<p>Experience pure island serenity at Hilton Seychelles Northolme Resort &amp; Spa, a 5-star sanctuary nestled on the north coast of Mah&eacute; in Glacis, just seven kilometers from Victoria. Surrounded by dramatic granite boulders, lush tropical gardens, and the crystal-blue Indian Ocean, this intimate retreat offers privacy, romance, and unforgettable luxury.</p>\n<p>This adults-friendly resort (minimum guest age: 13+) features exquisite private villas, each equipped with a spacious balcony and breathtaking ocean views. Elevate your stay with a Pool Villa, complete with your very own infinity pool &mdash; a private tropical escape designed for indulgence.</p>\n<p>Enjoy a host of complimentary water activities including snorkeling and kayaking, or unwind by the stunning ocean-facing infinity pool. Rejuvenate mind and body at the award-winning eforea Spa, offering healing therapies, body wraps, facials, and a relaxing steam room.</p>\n<p>The resort&rsquo;s culinary experiences celebrate fresh island ingredients: from handcrafted cocktails and al fresco dining to floating breakfasts and romantic candlelit dinners under the stars. For adventure seekers, choose from island excursions, hiking trails, championship golf, and scenic boat tours &mdash; Seychelles at its finest.</p>\n<p>Whether you're planning a romantic honeymoon, an exclusive getaway, or a small oceanfront event, Hilton Seychelles Northolme offers world-class service and tailored event support for weddings and special celebrations.</p>	8	5	5	Mahé, Seychelles	Mahe	-4.6837955	55.492638	\N	null	14:00	10:00	\N	hilton-seychelles-northolme-resort-spa	t	2025-11-04 21:05:36.949922+00	2025-11-04 21:09:12.548131+00	t
8	Chateau Elysium	<p>Stay in elegant rooms or private villas with pools on Mah&eacute;. Top service, beach access, and perfect getaways for couples and families.</p>	<p>Welcome to Seychelles Villas &mdash; your gateway to unforgettable island escapes on the breathtaking island of Mah&eacute;. With over 250,000 satisfied guests and a portfolio of exclusive luxury villas, we are proud to deliver world-class hospitality in one of the most beautiful destinations on Earth.</p>\n<p>Our flagship beachfront property, Chateau Elysium, is set directly on the iconic Beau Vallon Beach, just minutes from Victoria and the international airport. Offering 7 elegant king rooms in a charming colonial-style guesthouse and 6 private self-catering villas, we provide the perfect blend of comfort, privacy, and tropical elegance. Each villa features its own private plunge pool, veranda, and lush garden, while the main house boasts spacious lounges, a stunning outdoor dining area, and a sparkling swimming pool overlooking the ocean.</p>\n<p>Guests enjoy air-conditioned rooms, free WiFi, free parking, daily housekeeping in guesthouse rooms, and access to all shared facilities. With soft sandy shores at your doorstep, you can indulge in snorkeling, diving, watersports, sunset views, and a vibrant selection of restaurants and bars within walking distance.</p>	8	5	4	Mahé, Seychelles	Mahe	-4.6837955	55.492638	\N	null	\N	\N	\N	chateau-elysium	t	2025-11-04 21:35:30.991164+00	2025-11-04 21:35:30.991164+00	f
