52	Coin de Mire Attitude Hotel	<p>Coin de Mire Attitude Hotel</p>	<p>Coin de Mire Attitude Hotel</p>	7	5	3	Hotel Coin de Mire Attitude, Coastal Road, Camp Pavé, Cap Malheureux, Cap Malheureux VCA, Rivière du Rempart District, 30504, Mauritius	Cap Malheureux VCA	-19.98627902384081	57.60662128104615	\N	null	22:00	22:00	\N	coin-de-mire-attitude-hotel	t	2026-03-05 10:56:45.050852+00	2026-03-05 11:43:10.108341+00	t
64	Kyambura Gorge Lodge	<p>Kyambura Gorge Lodge: luxury safari lodge in Queen Elizabeth National Park overlooking the Kyambura Gorge, perfect for chimpanzee trekking and wildlife safaris.</p>	<p>Perched on the rim of the spectacular Kyambura Gorge in Queen Elizabeth National Park, Kyambura Gorge Lodge is one of Uganda&rsquo;s most exclusive luxury safari lodges. Overlooking a dramatic sunken rainforest known as the &ldquo;Valley of Apes,&rdquo; the lodge offers breathtaking views of the savannah plains and the majestic Rwenzori Mountains. Originally a coffee processing plant, the lodge has been beautifully transformed into an elegant eco-lodge featuring Afro-chic bandas designed with locally inspired d&eacute;cor and modern comforts. Guests enjoy world-class hospitality, gourmet cuisine, a tranquil swimming pool, and rejuvenating spa treatments after a day of exploration. The lodge provides unique access to the famous &ldquo;Lost Chimpanzees of Kyambura Gorge,&rdquo; along with exceptional wildlife viewing in Queen Elizabeth National Park. With its blend of luxury, conservation, and authentic African safari experiences, Kyambura Gorge Lodge is the perfect destination for travelers seeking adventure, nature, and unforgettable primate encounters in Uganda</p>	2	6	5	Kyambura, Kigabo, Rubirizi, Western Region, Uganda	Kigabo	-0.1394924	30.0872005	\N	null	14:00	11:00	\N	kyambura-gorge-lodge	t	2026-03-12 21:14:25.709645+00	2026-03-17 09:40:44.433915+00	f
66	Ishasha Wilderness Camp	<p>Ishasha Wilderness Camp offers luxury tented safaris in Queen Elizabeth NP, famous for tree-climbing lions, river views, wildlife encounters, and authentic bush experiences.</p>	<p>Ishasha Wilderness Camp is an intimate luxury tented safari camp in the Ishasha sector of Queen Elizabeth National Park, Uganda, beautifully set along the scenic Ntungwe River. Surrounded by riverine forest and open savannah, this exclusive wilderness retreat offers an authentic African safari experience in one of Uganda&rsquo;s most wildlife-rich regions. The Ishasha plains are world-famous for their rare tree-climbing lions, often seen resting in the branches of giant fig trees. Guests staying at the camp frequently encounter wildlife such as elephants, buffalo, colobus monkeys, vervet monkeys, and abundant birdlife moving freely around the area. Spacious safari-style tented rooms with private verandas overlook the river, offering comfort while keeping guests close to nature. The camp features a thatched lounge, bar, and riverside dining area where guests enjoy freshly prepared local and international cuisine. With game drives, bush breakfasts, sundowners, and breathtaking landscapes, Ishasha Wilderness Camp provides one of the best safari lodges in Queen Elizabeth National Park for unforgettable Uganda wildlife adventures.</p>	2	7	5	Ishasha, Runyinya, Nyaka Sub-County, Kanungu, Western Region, Uganda	Runyinya	-0.7578529	29.6304735	\N	null	14:00	11:00	\N	ishasha-wilderness-camp	t	2026-03-14 23:04:50.880702+00	2026-04-02 17:30:02.599684+00	t
58	LUX* Belle Mare	<p>LUX* Belle Mare is a 5-star beachfront resort in Mauritius offering luxury suites, white sand beaches, world-class dining, wellness, and family-friendly island experiences.</p>	<p>LUX* Belle Mare is a spectacular 5-star luxury beach resort in Mauritius, located on the famous Belle Mare beach on the island&rsquo;s stunning east coast. Renowned for its powder-soft white sand and turquoise lagoon, this award-winning resort blends minimalist architecture with tropical island design to create a stylish and relaxing holiday escape.</p>\n<p>The resort offers spacious luxury suites and private villas, world-class restaurants, beachfront experiences, and immersive wellness journeys inspired by nature. Guests can enjoy the vibrant atmosphere of Beach Rouge, one of the most iconic beach clubs in Mauritius, alongside gourmet dining, family-friendly activities, and rejuvenating spa treatments.</p>\n<p>Perfect for family holidays, romantic getaways, and luxury Mauritius vacations, LUX* Belle Mare delivers a unique blend of elegance, relaxation, and adventure. For travelers searching for the best luxury resorts in Mauritius, LUX* Belle Mare promises an unforgettable island experience where modern design meets tropical paradise.</p>	7	5	5	Lux Belle Mare, Belle Mare Palmar Trou d'Eau Douce Road, Mare du Puits, Belle Mare, Quatre Cocos VCA, Flacq, 41601, Mauritius	Quatre Cocos VCA	-20.1998056	57.7822079	\N	null	14:00	10:00	\N	lux-belle-mare	t	2026-03-10 21:13:32.968724+00	2026-04-05 19:11:05.684064+00	t
65	Ndali Lodge	<p>Ndali Lodge in Kibale National Park offers luxury crater-lake views, chimpanzee trekking, eco-friendly cottages, and authentic Uganda safari experiences.</p>	<p>Ndali Lodge is a charming luxury safari lodge in Kibale National Park, Uganda, overlooking the scenic Lake Nyinambuga near Fort Portal. Set on the rim of an extinct volcano within a 1,000-acre private estate, this owner-run lodge offers an authentic and tranquil Uganda safari experience surrounded by lush rainforest, crater lakes, and abundant wildlife. The lodge features eight spacious stone-and-thatch cottages with private verandas, offering breathtaking views of the surrounding landscapes. Guests enjoy exceptional hospitality, farm-to-table cuisine, and personalized service that reflects the warmth of Ugandan country living. Ndali Lodge is ideally located just 45 minutes from chimpanzee trekking in Kibale Forest, one of the world&rsquo;s best primate destinations. Visitors can also explore the Bigodi Wetlands Sanctuary, Mahoma Waterfalls, and the scenic crater lakes region. Powered by solar energy and committed to conservation and community development, Ndali Lodge blends comfort, sustainability, and adventure&mdash;making it one of the best eco-friendly safari lodges in Uganda.</p>	2	6	5	Kibale Forest, Kamwenge, Western Region, Uganda	Kibale Forest National Park	0.4478064	30.4231608	\N	null	14:00	11:00	\N	ndali-lodge	t	2026-03-14 22:53:56.650694+00	2026-04-02 17:35:32.540214+00	t
57	LUX* Le Morne Resort	<p>LUX* Le Morne is a 5-star beachfront resort in Mauritius offering stunning sunsets, luxury suites, dolphin encounters, and serene island living by Le Morne Mountain.</p>	<p>Nestled on the pristine shores of the Le Morne Peninsula in Mauritius, LUX* Le Morne is a stunning 5-star beachfront resort offering travelers a serene escape on the island&rsquo;s spectacular wild west coast. Set against the dramatic backdrop of the UNESCO-listed Le Morne Brabant Mountain, this luxury boutique resort blends tropical elegance with mindful island living. Guests enjoy powder-white beaches, crystal-clear lagoons, and some of the most breathtaking sunsets in Mauritius.</p>\n<p>LUX* Le Morne offers beautifully designed suites, world-class dining, wellness experiences, and unique activities including swimming with dolphins, beachfront yoga, and ocean adventures. From the charming Tree House dining experience to the stylish Maison LUX* caf&eacute;, every moment is crafted to inspire relaxation and discovery.</p>\n<p>Perfect for honeymoons, romantic getaways, and luxury Mauritius holidays, LUX* Le Morne delivers an authentic island experience where nature, comfort, and adventure come together in one extraordinary destination.</p>	7	5	5	Le Morne, Le Morne VCA, Black River, Mauritius	Le Morne VCA	-20.4442407	57.3256285	\N	null	14:00	12:00	5b32a522-1692-4fc6-b8bc-dc5930da4600	lux-le-morne-resort	t	2026-03-10 20:33:03.601516+00	2026-04-05 19:12:31.94613+00	t
23	Toa Hotel and Spa Zanzibar	<p>Beachfront Zanzibar resort with spa, pools, modern rooms, dining, and nearby attractions.</p>	<p>TOA Hotel &amp; Spa Zanzibar in Pongwe enjoys a prime beachfront location with direct access to the beach and beautiful sea views, offering guests a peaceful and scenic island escape. The property features comfortable, well-appointed rooms with air conditioning, private bathrooms, balconies, and modern amenities, with options including family rooms and private pool units to suit different traveler needs. Guests can relax and unwind with excellent facilities such as a spa and wellness center, fitness center, massage services, a year-round outdoor swimming pool, sun terrace, landscaped gardens, pool bar, coffee shop, and outdoor dining areas. The on-site family-friendly restaurant serves African, local, and international cuisine for lunch and dinner, complemented by live music and evening entertainment. Pongwe Beach is just steps away, while key attractions such as Jozani Chwaka Bay National Park and the Old Fort of Zanzibar are within easy reach, and the international airport is approximately 22 miles away.</p>	6	5	5	Pongwe, Kati, Zanzibar South & Central, Zanzibar, 73209, Tanzania	Pongwe	-6.0484341	39.4051943	\N	null	15:00	11:00	\N	toa-hotel-and-spa-zanzibar	t	2026-02-06 22:00:39.83769+00	2026-04-07 11:13:29.024922+00	f
137	Anantara Maia Seychelles Villas	<p>Anantara Maia Seychelles Villas offers ultra-luxury private villas, ocean views, all-inclusive service, and exclusive beach escapes in Seychelles.</p>	<p>Anantara Maia Seychelles Villas is the ultimate expression of luxury villas in Seychelles, offering an exclusive escape on a private peninsula between Anse Louis and Anse Boileau. Set across 30 acres of lush tropical gardens and pristine white-sand beaches, this award-winning resort blends privacy, personalized service, and natural beauty. Each villa, designed by renowned architect Bill Bensley, features infinity pools, ocean views, and a dedicated villa host delivering unmatched bespoke experiences. Guests enjoy world-class dining, including Creole, Mediterranean, and international cuisine, alongside unique experiences such as designer dining, spa treatments, and island excursions. Ideal for honeymoons, luxury holidays, and Seychelles beach getaways, the resort offers seamless access to snorkeling, kayaking, and island-hopping adventures. With its all-inclusive luxury concept and serene setting, Anantara Maia stands as one of the best luxury resorts in Seychelles for travelers seeking exclusivity and indulgence.</p>	8	5	5	Anantara Maia Seychelles Villas, West Coast Road, Anse Louis, Anse Boileau, Seychelles	Anse Louis, Mahé, Seychelles	-4.7172646	55.4798589	\N	null	14:00	10:00	\N	anantara-maia-seychelles-villas	t	2026-04-14 21:06:53.532074+00	2026-04-14 21:11:18.458989+00	t
