1	package	1	1	\N	Arrival Day	Description	Kencom, City Hall Way, City Square sublocation, Central Business District, CBD division, Starehe, Nairobi, Nairobi County, 40204, Kenya	-1.28563980	36.82498990	\N	2025-09-30 17:47:19.406659+00	\N
2	package	1	2	\N	Masai Mara Day	\N	Masai Mara National Reserve, Narok, Kenya	-1.48814310	35.10540950	\N	2025-09-30 17:48:09.968659+00	\N
3	package	2	1	\N	Day 1: Nairobi – Aberdare National Park	Depart Nairobi after breakfast or the Aberdare National Park   with a stop for lunch at The Aberdare Country Club, nestled on the slopes of Mweiga Hill. After lunch, set off for the Ark tree lodge, located in the forest on mountain slopes of the Aberdare Mountains. This outstanding lodge offers high altitude game viewing, including animals that are rarely encountered elsewhere: Giant forest hog, Bush Pig, Tree Hyrax, Large Spotted Genet, and the elusive Bongo Antelope.Wildlife can be observed from different levels – and from outside where you can see, hear and smell everything and inside where you can sit with a cup of tea and stay warm and cozy. You can put in a request to be awakened during the night if your favorite animals show up. A herd of Elephants might be just feet away and if you are lucky, a Leopard or large male Lion might put in an appearance.Dinner and overnight at your preferred accommodation.	Nairobi, Nairobi County, Kenya	-1.30261480	36.82884200	Accommodation in NAIROBI	2025-10-23 21:16:11.438072+00	\N
4	package	2	2	\N	Aberdare National Park – Lake Nakuru National Park	After breakfast depart by road and proceed to Lake Nakuru National Park, arriving at mid morning for a game drive before checking-in at your accommodation for Lunch. A spectacular afternoon game drive is planned. The park is one of the Kenya’s greatest World bird watching haven, famous for its millions of pink flamingoes lining on the lake shore. The Park is also Sanctuary to the Black Rhino, White Rhino and the Rothschild Giraffe. Bird life include common species like the lesser and Greater Flamingoes, African fish Eagle, Tawny Eagle, Green Wood Hoopoes, Cliff Chat, Great White and Pink Backed Pelicans plus other intra- African Migrants.	Aberdare National Park Shamata Gate, D388, mairo inya, Ndaragwa, Nyandarua, Kenya	-0.20495220	36.52882490	Mt. Kenya  Safari Club	2025-10-23 21:19:27.568917+00	\N
5	package	2	3	\N	Lake Nakuru National –Maasai Mara Game Reserve	After a delicious breakfast at your lodge, depart by road to the Masai Mara Game Reserve–jewel of Kenya's Game Park, arriving in time for lunch. This enormous Reserve actually part of the vast Serengeti plains is famously known for its spectacular great wildebeest migration and is a true home of the big five-Lion, Elephant, Leopard, Rhino and Cape Buffalo. After lunch, explore the Reserve on a late evening game drive while enjoying the majestic vistas before retiring to your accommodation for dinner and overnight.	Lake Nakuru, Barut ward, Nakuru West, Nakuru, Kenya	-0.36392480	36.08726970	Lake Nakuru  Lodge	2025-10-23 21:21:02.950568+00	\N
6	package	2	4	\N	Maasai Mara Game Reserve	This day you will have full day filled with exciting tour activities in Maasai Mara.  Begin your day with an early morning game drive or optional hot Air Balloon rides (available at an additional cost) .Visit a Maasaivillageto enjoy the friendly and authentic hospitality coupled with exciting   dances and tales of the culturally rich Maasaicommunity. Return to your lodge / camp   for leisurely lunch then proceed for an afternoon game drive  with chances  of viewing plain  games like Masai Giraffe, Buffalo, Impala, Zebra, Topi, both the Thomson's and Grant's Gazelles. Return to your accommodation for dinner and overnight.	Masai Mara National Reserve, Narok, Kenya	-1.48814310	35.10540950	Ashnil Mara Camp	2025-10-23 21:22:12.962348+00	\N
7	package	18	1	\N	Arrival in Dubai – Meet, Assist & Private Airport Transfer	Upon arrival at Dubai International Airport, you’ll be received by our Allbound Vacations representative for warm meet-and-assist services. After immigration support, enjoy a smooth private transfer to your hotel. Settle in and relax for the exciting week ahead.	Dubai Emirate, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	25.07428230	55.18853870	Accommodation of Choice	2026-01-26 21:01:11.057035+00	\N
8	package	18	2	\N	Dubai City Tour + Burj Khalifa + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo	• Enjoy a half-day Dubai city tour with an English-speaking guide, exploring top highlights like Jumeirah Beach, Burj Al Arab (photo stop), Atlantis The Palm, Zabeel Palace, and traditional Dubai.\n• Visit the Burj Khalifa – 124th Floor (Non-Peak) and witness breathtaking panoramic views.\n• Continue to Dubai Mall Aquarium & Underwater Zoo, one of the world’s largest indoor marine exhibits.	Dubai Emirate, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	25.07428230	55.18853870	Accommodation of Choice	2026-01-26 21:04:21.73877+00	\N
9	package	18	3	\N	The View at The Palm + Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner	• Visit The View at The Palm (Non-Peak) for stunning aerial views of Palm Jumeirah’s iconic architecture.\n• In the afternoon, head for a Standard Desert Safari featuring dune bashing, camel rides, desert sunset photos, BBQ dinner, live belly dance, and entertainment.	Dubai Emirate, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	25.07428230	55.18853870	Accommodation of Choice	2026-01-26 21:06:21.1262+00	\N
10	package	18	4	\N	Marina Dhow Cruise with Dinner	• Experience an unforgettable evening aboard a Dubai Marina Dhow Cruise, including a buffet dinner, soft drinks, and live entertainment as you enjoy Dubai’s illuminated skyline.	Dubai Emirate, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	25.07428230	55.18853870	Accommodation of Choice	2026-01-26 21:08:30.773051+00	\N
11	package	18	5	\N	Aquaventure Waterpark & Lost Chambers Aquarium	• Spend a full day at Atlantis Aquaventure, the world’s largest waterpark—home to thrilling slides, private beaches, and splash zones.\n• Explore the Lost Chambers Aquarium, inspired by the myth of Atlantis and filled with 65,000 marine creatures.	Dubai Emirate, Dubai, United Arab Emirates	25.07428230	55.18853870	Accommodation of Choice	2026-01-26 21:10:28.678654+00	\N
