54	package	37	3	\N	Murchison Falls National Park - Game Drives and Launch Cruise	Start the day with a refreshing cup of coffee and muffins, then embark on an early morning game drive with your guide. Explore the open savannah plains of Murchison Falls National Park, where you may spot the Big Five (elephants, lions, buffaloes, Rothschild Giraffes, and Jackson Hartebeest) along with other wildlife species like Uganda Kobs, Oribis, Waterbucks, and various birds.\nReturn to the lodge for a leisurely breakfast and some relaxation time, perhaps taking a dip in the pool. After lunch, enjoy a tranquil boat cruise to the base of the waterfalls, offering a unique perspective on the park's wildlife. Look out for hippos, crocodiles, buffaloes, elephants, and numerous water birds. For the best views and photo opportunities, sit on the left side of the boat. As you approach the falls, you can disembark and hike to the top for a breath-taking panorama of the falls from different angles - an unforgettable experience!	Murchison Falls National Park, Nwoya, Northern Region, Uganda	2.39005180	31.66211630	Overnight stay at Nile Safari Lodge or Sambiya River Lodge for Midrange \nMeal Plan: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner	2026-03-14 21:05:41.795136+00	\N
