8	08 Day-Cairo & Nile Cruise Package	Explore Cairo’s top sites and sail the Nile to Luxor and Aswan, visiting temples, museums, and ancient wonders in one unforgettable Egypt tour.\n	<p>Experience the ultimate Egypt tour combining Cairo&rsquo;s ancient wonders with a luxurious Nile Cruise. Begin in Cairo with guided visits to Memphis, the iconic Giza Pyramids, the Sphinx, and the Grand Egyptian Museum. Fly to Aswan and board your Nile Cruise to explore the High Dam, Unfinished Obelisk, and the stunning Philae Temple. Sail along the Nile to discover the temples of Kom Ombo and Edfu before reaching Luxor for breathtaking sites including the Valley of the Kings, Queen Hatshepsut Temple, Karnak Temple, and Luxor Temple. Return to Cairo for immersive cultural tours featuring the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization, the Royal Mummies Hall, the historic Salah El-Din Citadel, the Alabaster Mosque, and Old Cairo. This Egypt travel package offers the perfect blend of history, culture, and comfort ideal for families, couples, and groups seeking an unforgettable Cairo and Nile Cruise experience.</p>	5	7	1100	\N	\N	\N	c590bca2-5869-4120-6489-1e27a9618201	08-day-cairo-nile-cruise-package	t	f	f	2025-11-17 17:38:17.709069+00	2026-03-20 14:56:37.423415+00	\N	t	\N	\N
