2	Ultimate Highland to Savannah Safari 	Embark on a 5-day Kenya Safari through Aberdare, Lake Nakuru, and Maasai Mara — a journey of breathtaking landscapes, thrilling wildlife, and unforgettable cultural encounters across Kenya’s wild beauty.	<p>Embark on an unforgettable 5 Days Kenya Safari through three of Kenya&rsquo;s most iconic wildlife destinations &mdash; Aberdare National Park, Lake Nakuru National Park, and the world-famous Maasai Mara Game Reserve.<br>This safari is perfect for travelers seeking breathtaking landscapes, incredible wildlife encounters, and authentic cultural experiences. From the lush mountain forests of Aberdare to the pink-hued flamingo shores of Lake Nakuru and the endless savannah plains of the Maasai Mara, each destination reveals a new layer of Kenya&rsquo;s natural beauty.<br>Enjoy thrilling game drives, rich birdlife, and stunning photographic opportunities, all while staying in some of Kenya&rsquo;s most serene safari lodges and camps.</p>	1	5	1000	\N	\N	\N	7985b3e4-2c98-4b11-1643-12ba222f1901	ultimate-highland-to-savannah-safari	t	t	f	2025-10-11 13:55:59.665702+00	2025-10-19 07:52:00.069039+00	\N	f	\N	\N
